// RUN: spyre-triton-opt %s --rewrite-descriptor-layout-generic | FileCheck %s

// Attributes this pass does not own must survive physicalization.
//
// This is a regression test for a reported bug in RewriteDescriptorLayout, which
// builds each physical op fresh from an enumerated subset of the original's
// fields -- so a field nobody listed is dropped without a diagnostic. Running the
// old pass on this same input drops both attributes below; this pass clones the
// original and replaces only the shape, so they ride along and a field added to
// either op later is carried without this pass being touched.

